  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Commonwealth Investment Network</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Small Island Developing States (SIDS) find it harder than other nations to attract the investment they need. The Commonwealth Investment Network will establish an ecosystem of growth-oriented local, regional and international partners working together to identify investment opportunities across Commonwealth SIDS, provide tailored technical assistance to select projects to increase their bankability, and nurture investment pipelines that will build climate-resilient and sustainable economies.</narrative>
  </description>
